      {
         "id": "SECTION_introduction",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Introduction\n\nIn the previous class we visited some of the first tools created by humanity to count. Now we return to the same tools, but with a new goal: to add. In each game you will add two numbers between 1 and 9, and the result will always be 10 or more, so you will always need to carry (<htcite0>; <htcite1>).",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "a4caa9fe-de1e-49c5-92de-50ed9c22a42d",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Practicing addition",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "687a38b5-de0e-4d16-a4d0-8ec87a545ccb",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
