      {
         "id": "SECTION_yupana",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### In America: Adding with the Yupana\n\nThe yupana, used together with the quipus, places seeds on a grid where each row is a place value. Adding with the yupana means placing the total in the rows and moving a seed to the next row when a row reaches ten (<htcite0>; <htcite1>).\n\n#### The Game\n\nAdd the two numbers and represent the result on the yupana. The result is 10 or more, so the tens row will also receive seeds.",
