               "text": "### In Russia: Adding with the Schyoty\n\nThe schyoty is a vertical abacus in which each row is a place value. To add, move the beads until the rows show the total (<htcite0>).\n\n#### The Game\n\nAdd the two numbers and follow the steps shown below the schyoty: first write the first number, then add the second and carry 1 to the tens row. The result is always 10 or more, so the tens row will also show beads.",
